    "turn_idx": 169,
    "turn_text": "Every one of my family's a cop. Okay. I don't, you know, probably not going to find a show anywhere that's more supportive of law enforcement than this one. Okay. So I don't think it's ideal. That being said, these guys have also served four years in prison. Okay. A lot of them were facing five years or six years. So you could get out technically on good behavior. I'm not necessarily justifying this, but understand one of the reasons this happened is because there are a lot of people who were overzealously prosecuted to make a political point for the Democrats. And there were a lot of people who were abused. The prisons have since been accused. And in some instances, accurately as described as abusing these prisoners, keeping them in solitary, holding people indefinitely. And a lot of folks felt like the feds played a heavy hand in what went down that day at the Capitol. which is one of the reasons why Joe Biden preemptively pardoned Mark Millie is people believe Millie had a hand. You know, Mark Millie, the guy who famously said that he was tipping off China. on what Donald Trump's military maneuvers were. I mean, think about",
